    "Word of mouth compounds off the customers you already have, so every day before launch is growth you never get back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Word of mouth compounds off the customers you already have, so every day before launch is growth you never get back."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El boca a boca se multiplica sobre los clientes que ya tienes, así que cada día antes de lanzar es crecimiento que no recuperas."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Growth panel: why launching early matters"
    },
    "Work halted for a safety review after an on-site incident.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Work halted for a safety review after an on-site incident."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El trabajo se detuvo para una revisión de seguridad tras un incidente en el sitio."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Incident description"
    },
    "Work stops dead when a package runs out of materials — and the crew keeps drawing full pay while it waits.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Work stops dead when a package runs out of materials — and the crew keeps drawing full pay while it waits."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El trabajo se detiene en seco cuando una partida se queda sin material — y la cuadrilla sigue cobrando completo mientras espera."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Help bullet"
    },
    "Workers get faster the longer they stay on one package. A seasoned worker produces well over twice what they did on day one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Workers get faster the longer they stay on one package. A seasoned worker produces well over twice what they did on day one."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La gente se vuelve más rápida mientras más tiempo lleva en una partida. Alguien con oficio produce más del doble que en su primer día."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Help bullet"
    },
    "You are paid a fixed sum to deliver a building by a fixed date. Everything you spend comes out of that.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You are paid a fixed sum to deliver a building by a fixed date. Everything you spend comes out of that."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Te pagan una suma fija por entregar un edificio en una fecha fija. Todo lo que gastes sale de ahí."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Help bullet"
    },
    "You are ranked on profit: what the client paid, minus everything the job cost you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You are ranked on profit: what the client paid, minus everything the job cost you."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se te clasifica por utilidad: lo que pagó el cliente menos todo lo que costó la obra."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Help bullet"
    },
    "You can sell every unit at a profit and still miss payroll, because the money is on a ship.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can sell every unit at a profit and still miss payroll, because the money is on a ship."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puedes vender cada unidad con ganancia y aun así no cubrir la nómina, porque el dinero va en un barco."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Scenario signature lesson"
    },
